write_week.prompt:
Generate the content calendar entries for {week_pick} of {duration_weeks} weeks for {brand}.

Channels: {channels}
Topics: {topics}
Cadence: {cadence}
Start date: {start_date}

Calendar outline:
{calendar_outline}

Research findings:
{week_findings}

For each entry, provide:
- **Date:** (calculate from start_date + week offset)
- **Channel:** (one of: {channels})
- **Content Type:** (blog post, social update, email newsletter, etc.)
- **Title:** (specific, compelling title)
- **Brief:** (2-3 sentences describing the content)
- **Keywords:** (3-5 relevant keywords)
- **CTA:** (specific call to action)

Ensure variety across topics and channels. Each channel should have at least one entry per week based on the {cadence} cadence.
